      "description": "Someone's missing. You've got their phone. Everything they hid is still on it.\n\nRead the texts they deleted. Open the photos they hid. Follow the lies and name who's behind it before time runs out.\n\nSnitchy is a fictional detective game.\n\nUnlock a simulated smartphone, search messages, photos, emails, and social apps, collect clues, and accuse the culprit before the timer hits zero.\n\nAll characters and evidence are invented for entertainment.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nUnlock the phone and read the case briefing\nDig through messages, photos, emails, and apps\nLong-press anything suspicious to analyze clues\nBuild your case in the Casebook — then accuse\nGuess wrong or run out of time, and the round is over\n\nWHY YOU'LL BE HOOKED\n\nA real-feeling phone: Messages, Photos, Notes, Calls, Calendar, browser, maps, and more\nDeleted messages, hidden photos, fake names — the truth is buried, you dig it out\nFictional mature stories: crime, cheating, relationship drama\nCasebook, timer, mistake limit, and a global leaderboard\nOptional hints when you're stuck. \nNo sign-in required to start\nEnglish, French, and Spanish\n\nFREE & PREMIUM CONTENT\n\nSnitchy Pro unlocks premium cases, hint quotes, and new cases as they release.\nA free case is always available; premium content requires a subscription.\n\nCONTENT NOTICE\n\nSnitchy contains fictional mature themes including crime, infidelity, and relationship drama. Intended for users 17+.\nSimulated apps and brand references in the game are fictional only and not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any real companies.\n\nABOUT SNITCHY PRO SUBSCRIPTION\n\nPlans available: Weekly, Monthly, and Annual, shown in the App Store at the time of purchase.\nPayment is charged to your Apple Account at confirmation of purchase.\nSubscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\nYour account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current period, at the selected plan price.\nYou can manage subscriptions and turn off auto-renew in your account settings after purchase.\nAny unused portion of a free trial, if offered, is forfeited when you subscribe.\n\nPublished by YM Labs. No account required; an anonymous ID is created on your device for the leaderboard.\nNo advertising SDKs and no cross-app tracking are used. App Tracking Transparency permission is not requested.\nThe camera is used only for the in-game flashlight and simulated camera. No photos are saved or uploaded.\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://app.notion.com/p/Last-Seen-Privacy-Policy-398f39ec1cf780af967ff57ba9573324\n\nEULA — Apple Standard License Agreement:\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\n\nSupport:\nhttps://tally.so/r/QKWGBp",
